Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.96,0:00:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.67,0:00:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《我獨自升級 第二季\N-起於闇影-》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:01:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已經過多久了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.22,0:01:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大概3小時左右…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.44,0:02:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,裡面大概已經過了3天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.02,0:02:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,紅色傳送門內的環境\N可是非常嚴酷的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.40,0:02:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個成振宇八成也掛了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.64,0:02:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,害我白跑一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不對
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.70,0:02:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個成振宇不是白虎公會的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.86,0:02:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他會跟你的攻擊隊一起進入傳送門
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他跟我說\N想看看C級任務是什麼樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.74,0:02:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才帶他過來的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.86,0:02:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原來是這樣啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.58,0:02:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以為我會這麼說嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你這次又在打什麼主意啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.86,0:02:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,畢竟你從以前\N就很擅長發掘新鮮事物嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黃東秀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.72,0:02:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把你的手給我放開
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:02:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是在命令我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.14,0:03:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就憑你這個\N小小國家裡的一個公會長
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:10.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟…糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.24,0:03:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不快點阻止他們的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.82,0:03:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,會演變成S級獵人間的衝突的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想打是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.20,0:03:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是因為太冷…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.58,0:03:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不對…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.70,0:03:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要有裝備的話
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.22,0:03:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我根本就不會輸…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才在想說為何沒看到半隻冰熊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,難不成…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.70,0:03:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是那群E級的傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.92,0:03:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.82,0:03:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他們不可能有這種實力…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.26,0:03:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.50,0:03:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是白鬼…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.80,0:03:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有白鬼在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挺厲害的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是兩位沒有先收起力道的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.36,0:04:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的手臂可能就已經斷了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道黃獵人你是在懷疑什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.50,0:04:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但大約在兩個月前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.16,0:04:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有再度對成獵人進行魔力探測
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.68,0:04:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的確是E級獵人沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.36,0:04:29.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,監察科在調查過後得出結論
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.94,0:04:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也確認了黃東石獵人\N是命喪於魔獸之手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.44,0:04:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是你們"對外"的說法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.48,0:04:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是顯而易見的謊言
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:44.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看動手殺人的\N是那個柳軫建設的少爺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你又為何要追殺成獵人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.98,0:04:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那當然…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.24,0:04:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不過是個藉口罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.68,0:04:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一個殺人的藉口
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.64,0:05:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是個走運的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.14,0:05:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黃獵人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最瞭解成獵人實力的人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.90,0:05:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他一定會活著出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.90,0:05:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然後我買武器的錢就全沒了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 是真的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.42,0:05:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,差了一位數欸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.78,0:05:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,實力弱小的你們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼會還活著
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,禦寒衣物加上毛毯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,連帳篷與食物都有…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.40,0:05:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.86,0:05:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原來是這麼回事啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.50,0:05:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你們這群混帳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.60,0:05:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,金獵人?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.98,0:05:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們攻擊隊全軍覆沒了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全都是因為缺乏糧食與裝備
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.80,0:05:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是誰將這些東西藏起來的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.86,0:05:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是誰將所有裝備獨佔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.80,0:05:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,將其他同伴推向死亡的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:06:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原來如此 我懂了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,熙臻姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.98,0:06:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妳打從一開始就知道了是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.54,0:06:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以才會換來這一隊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是不肯招供\N我就當你們全都是共犯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.22,0:06:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我數到3 自己乖乖向我坦承
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-2\N-犯人就是那個傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成振宇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.00,0:06:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你才是把同伴推向死亡的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.66,0:06:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.74,0:06:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,居然還讓麻煩跟了過來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,解除隱身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.66,0:06:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這種強大氣息是藏不住的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.72,0:06:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些傢伙 是冰之妖精
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且還數量眾多…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.86,0:06:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就是BOSS嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.76,0:06:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這群垃圾之中
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.90,0:06:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,居然還真的有還算中用的傢伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.13,0:07:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你該不會是在說我們都是垃圾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(喔…還真是令人驚訝)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.26,0:07:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小子 你聽得懂我們的語言嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.62,0:07:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,為何我會聽得懂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.74,0:07:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能聽得懂魔獸的語言嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這也是系統帶來的影響嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.10,0:07:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然能對話 那這樣正好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.14,0:07:25.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是這個傢伙跟我說的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.26,0:07:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他告訴我人類之中有個高手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是他說想要跟你比個高下…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.38,0:07:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然後呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.94,0:07:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看來沒辦法三兩下就解決他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.06,0:07:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,越來越有趣了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:07:57.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,話說回來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.46,0:08:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你明明不是人類
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.38,0:08:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,為何會混在人類之中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看來你連自己是誰都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.68,0:08:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們會一直聽到一個聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.26,0:08:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要我們去殺了人類
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然而面對你 我卻什麼都聽不到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,聽到聲音?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.42,0:08:21.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是跟系統命令相似的東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.42,0:08:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那他面對我時會聽不到聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是因為我變成了"玩家"嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.50,0:08:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們之間沒有必要戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.20,0:08:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用兩全其美的方式來解決問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.94,0:08:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把你身後的人類交出來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.72,0:08:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如此一來 我們就保你一命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.90,0:08:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.94,0:08:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你覺得這個提議如何
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.72,0:08:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你們到底是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,為何要與人類戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.72,0:08:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.38,0:08:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把你身後的人類交出來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.06,0:08:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如此一來 我們就保你一命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:08:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,剛剛那是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.54,0:08:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.62,0:09:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你覺得這個提議如何
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.84,0:09:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定是會接受的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.54,0:09:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.90,0:09:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是打算與我們為敵嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.18,0:09:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在人數上你可是壓倒性的劣勢呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.44,0:09:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你說誰是劣勢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.50,0:09:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是…是怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.06,0:09:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怪物出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.50,0:09:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是黑色的士兵與黑色的冰熊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.84,0:09:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,難道說這些…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成獵人 都是你做的嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.92,0:09:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還想垂死掙扎啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.36,0:09:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,垂死掙扎…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.94,0:09:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.62,0:10:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快離開
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這不是我們能介入的戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他確實有說大話的本錢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.88,0:10:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雖說不會消滅\N但每次再生都會消耗瑪那
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.00,0:10:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的瑪那也無法持續太久…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.78,0:10:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且那個BOSS…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.78,0:10:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎麼看 他都比我強
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.60,0:10:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感覺和伊格利特聯手\N也無法輕易打倒他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.10,0:10:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只靠一般士兵會沒完沒了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.70,0:10:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要更強大的戰力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫巴魯卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什麼名字
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.98,0:10:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成振宇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很久沒遇到令我如此興奮的戰鬥了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.28,0:11:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最後的那個聲音…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成振宇…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.08,0:11:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多虧有魔法兵幫我爭取了點時間…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.14,0:11:49.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再來就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的士兵就只有這點能耐嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.22,0:11:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成振宇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.44,0:11:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.10,0:12:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就連人類也背棄你了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,無聊至極
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.28,0:12:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這種障眼法
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.20,0:12:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成振宇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,金哲…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.48,0:12:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,果然不出我所料…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.80,0:12:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,無聊至極
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.30,0:12:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成振宇…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.66,0:12:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你這傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.76,0:12:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打從一開始…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就料到我會來了嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.48,0:12:46.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可惡…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.26,0:12:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.18,0:12:55.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這種障眼法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.42,0:13:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾恩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,從今天起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就叫艾恩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.84,0:13:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挺有意思的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.06,0:13:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就從你開始解決
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.20,0:13:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,動作也太慢了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.56,0:13:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,熙臻姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,獵人們的戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.94,0:13:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是這個樣子的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.46,0:13:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎麼可能當得上獵人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.44,0:13:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我從來沒見過這種場面…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.48,0:13:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們…應該不是在作夢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.30,0:14:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這傢伙不夠我打
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.26,0:14:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,站在那邊的你還有那個騎士
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全都一起上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.20,0:14:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.06,0:14:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首先
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.50,0:14:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,從你開始解決
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這種狀況下居然還能避開要害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也太小看我了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.92,0:14:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的確很強…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.30,0:14:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.46,0:14:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你底下的人就不一定了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.80,0:14:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.98,0:14:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你一死 那些小兵就不足為懼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.30,0:15:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,居然把武器丟掉 還真是愚蠢…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾恩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.18,0:15:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你們挺不錯的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要殺光你們所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.60,0:15:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,勝負已經分曉了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.00,0:15:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還沒完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:15:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我說過了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.18,0:16:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,勝負已經分曉了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.60,0:16:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,總算是擊倒他了嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.74,0:16:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.64,0:16:17.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.34,0:16:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,適可而止喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前途堪慮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.26,0:16:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,結束了…是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.16,0:16:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.18,0:16:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼我們出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.62,0:16:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去傳送門外
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.46,0:16:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.44,0:16:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.94,0:16:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,總算能出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.70,0:16:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好漫長啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.22,0:17:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在那之前…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.72,0:17:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,傳送門裡差不多過了一個禮拜了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們會留在這裡待命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.72,0:17:16.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,社長您就先回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.98,0:17:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,公會成員被困在裡面
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.92,0:17:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能就這樣自己回去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.92,0:17:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要在這裡等到天亮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人影…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.80,0:17:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人走出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.02,0:17:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,金獵人…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道你可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.00,0:17:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白社長
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,朴獵人…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.04,0:17:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高獵人…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.58,0:17:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,總之 你們沒事就好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.90,0:17:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他獵人怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成獵人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.60,0:17:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.22,0:18:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,傳送門…消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.00,0:18:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他的獵人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,金獵人呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他們…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.38,0:18:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,活著出來的 就只有下級獵人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,裡面究竟發生了什麼事…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.90,0:18:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我送妳回家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.98,0:18:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好…好的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.80,0:18:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請留步
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.12,0:18:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有些事情想請教你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.40,0:18:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已經累了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.32,0:18:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什麼話 請你去問公會的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.42,0:18:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這不是請求
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.16,0:18:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是命令 甚至是威脅
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這次的事件
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.98,0:18:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,讓本公會的6名成員下落不明
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.20,0:18:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我身為負責人 必須問你幾個問題
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.98,0:18:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或許是這樣沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但也是我救了那剩下的兩人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.90,0:18:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,身為負責人的你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:53.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是應該先向我道謝嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.10,0:19:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恕我失禮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.98,0:19:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你說得沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.62,0:19:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,朴獵人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.66,0:19:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.98,0:19:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個人是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.04,0:19:17.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,為何說話態度那麼差
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.46,0:19:18.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不清楚…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.70,0:19:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在擊倒BOSS後
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.24,0:19:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的心情就突然變得很糟…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.86,0:19:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他應該是覺得相當疲憊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.40,0:19:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他並不是個壞人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.70,0:19:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安科長
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.02,0:19:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請你無論如何\N都要將他帶進我們公會
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.54,0:19:37.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.50,0:19:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我果然沒有看走眼…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.70,0:19:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回去路上請小心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.32,0:19:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.34,0:19:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個 振宇哥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.24,0:19:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,振宇哥?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天…真的很謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.56,0:19:58.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們明天…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.76,0:19:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不對
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.96,0:20:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是晚點見了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.92,0:20:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.32,0:20:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,外界連一天都還沒過完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,結果感覺還不賴的報酬\N就只有這個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.60,0:20:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是因為我和他的能力值\N相差太多嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.14,0:20:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抽了3次 全都失敗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.46,0:20:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(已失敗3次 無法繼續抽取)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.60,0:20:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做了一次大白工
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.84,0:20:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.82,0:20:44.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.12,0:20:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是第3次了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.72,0:20:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.18,0:20:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把早餐吃掉了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.24,0:20:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去吃了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.02,0:21:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.94,0:21:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是用這副打扮過來的嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.18,0:21:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我們出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.98,0:21:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.54,0:21:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們路上順便去接個人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.56,0:21:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.44,0:21:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,隊長 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.60,0:21:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊…嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.10,0:21:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早安…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.08,0:21:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉還讓你特地來接我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.94,0:21:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,振宇哥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.00,0:21:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,振宇哥?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.46,0:21:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那之後有稍微睡一下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.84,0:21:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完全睡不著
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.16,0:21:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也是 畢竟妳到家時都天亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.02,0:21:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊\N-天亮才回家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.54,0:21:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完全沒睡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.56,0:21:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,振宇哥你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.64,0:21:37.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你們原來是這種關係嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.78,0:21:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-妳先睡一下吧 到了再叫妳起來\N-那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.74,0:21:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-謝謝你\N-大哥?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.22,0:21:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.08,0:21:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,韓小姐她…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.98,0:21:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還沒成年呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.70,0:21:47.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.34,0:21:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒事…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.50,0:21:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.30,0:21:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,趕快出發 早點把事情解決掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 振宇哥
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.12,0:22:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.08,0:22:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《我獨自升級》
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.75,0:22:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(#14 你應該沒意識到)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.76,0:23:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(第15話 還有很長的路要走)
